INCLUDE ../../Global.ink
~ ChangeSpeaker("SCOUT")
Scout: Woah! That was awesome! Where did that come from?
    * "I didn’t mean to do that" 
    But you did! And you did it really, really well!
    I mean, it was BRUTAL, but you kind of had to do it. She wasn’t gonna budge any other way.
    -> converge1
    * "What’s happening to me?!"
    You’re getting serious, that’s what’s happening! You’re becoming a badass!
    It was a matter of survival. Kind of overkill, but she would’ve done the same if she were in your shoes… more or less.
    It’s not like you had any other choice. Cheer up. You’re gonna have to get used to it.
    -> converge1
==== converge1 ====
*"This isn't who I am"
Everyone’s got the capacity for violence, Meanie. Good, bad, whatever. Labels like that, they’re just words.
You did what you had to do. Maybe a little more than that. That’s all there is to it.
We should get going while we’ve got moonlight to burn.
And seriously, don’t dwell on… whatever just happened. Just follow me. I know what to do. I can keep us safe.
Soon, we’ll be entirely new people.
Come on.
    -> END
